msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did not expect I would be able to have such a...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫normal social "
"interaction—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫and not because I’m awkward or a poor conversationalist."
msgstr ""
