"interlocutore."

#: scenario8:scenario8_17AD6527_018D_4DD6_B5EC_A1AE10B3AEDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8d5d3646b2be1d34a291805dfd84801f7f384a6600a6efa31e5e3531ebf32c7
