msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For most of my life, I was cursed. Irregular. And you were the only one who ⟪k:3⟫"
"didn’t⟪k:4⟫ treat me like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per quasi tutta la vita, sono stato maledetto. Sono stato anormale. E tu sei stata "
"l’unica a non avermi trattato così."

